 "_flex_align_self": "center"}, "elements": [{"id": "13a8cd8", "settings": {"title": "Prestamistas Privados en Barcelona", "header_size": "h1", "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_family": "Roboto", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 28, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_weight": "300", "title_color": "#598199", "_margin": {"unit": "%", "top": "-2", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "__dynamic__": {"title": "[elementor-tag id=\"36988ea\" name=\"page-title\" settings=\"%7B%7D\"]"}, "_element_width": "initial", "_element_custom_width": {"unit": "%", "size": 100, "sizes": []}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "%", "top": "", "right": "", "bottom": "", "left": "", "isLinked": true}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "%", "top": "", "right": "", "bottom": "", "left": "", "isLinked": true}, "align": "center", "typography_font_size_mobile": {"unit": "px", "size": 18, "sizes": []}, "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "4e7956b"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "8a4101f"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "heading", "elType": "widget"}], "isInner": true, "elType": "container"}, {"id": "b5f00db", "settings": {"editor": "<p>En <a href=\"https://proactivofinance.com/\"><strong>ProActivo Finance</strong></a> ayudamos a empresas, inversores, promotores y propietarios que buscan <strong>prestamistas privados en Barcelona</strong> para obtener liquidez r\u00e1pida con una <strong>garant\u00eda inmobiliaria</strong> s\u00f3lida.</p><p>Barcelona es un mercado exigente: operaciones de compraventa, reformas, refinanciaciones, oportunidades inmobiliarias y situaciones urgentes no siempre pueden esperar los plazos de la banca tradicional. Por eso trabajamos con <strong>capital privado</strong>, <strong>an\u00e1lisis flexible</strong> y formalizaci\u00f3n ante notario.</p><p>Si cuentas con un inmueble en Barcelona, el \u00e1rea metropolitana o zonas de alto valor como Sarri\u00e0-Sant Gervasi, Eixample, Pedralbes, Diagonal Mar o Sant Cugat, podemos estudiar una soluci\u00f3n ajustada a tu caso sin depender \u00fanicamente de n\u00f3mina, scoring bancario o historial financiero.</p>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"link_color": "", "link_hover_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "134a587"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "cd8775a"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "d72ef6d", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}}, "elements": [{"id": "353245c", "settings": {"title": "Qu\u00e9 ofrecen los prestamistas privados en Barcelona", "align": "center", "typography_typography": "custom", "title_color": "#FFFFFF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "63da8a2"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "1ae9a78"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "heading", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "a923b4b", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Un prestamista privado profesional no funciona como una entidad bancaria tradicional. La operaci\u00f3n se analiza principalmente desde el valor del inmueble, la viabilidad jur\u00eddica, el importe solicitado y la salida prevista del pr\u00e9stamo.</p><p>En ProActivo Finance trabajamos como alternativa seria para quienes necesitan liquidez con rapidez, pero tambi\u00e9n con estructura. La operaci\u00f3n se plantea con contrato, transparencia y <strong>firma ante notario</strong>, evitando soluciones improvisadas o poco claras.</p><p>Esta v\u00eda puede encajar cuando buscas <a href=\"https://proactivofinance.com/prestamo-capital-privado-en-barcelona-proactivo-finance\"><strong>financiaci\u00f3n privada en Barcelona</strong></a> para resolver una necesidad empresarial, ejecutar una inversi\u00f3n o cancelar cargas antes de que el problema avance.</p>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"link_color": "", "link_hover_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "4c75fea"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "60935f7"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}], "isInner": true, "elType": "container"}, {"id": "010e360", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}}, "elements": [{"id": "a13f2a4", "settings": {"title": "Cu\u00e1ndo acudir a prestamistas privados en Barcelona", "align": "center", "typography_typography": "custom", "title_color": "#FFFFFF", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "020", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "fdf1cbf"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "226475a"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "heading", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "da62957", "settings": {"editor": "<p>La financiaci\u00f3n privada tiene sentido cuando existe una <strong>garant\u00eda inmobiliaria</strong> y el tiempo es un factor importante. No se trata solo de conseguir dinero r\u00e1pido, sino de estructurar una operaci\u00f3n que permita resolver una necesidad concreta sin vender patrimonio de forma precipitada.</p><p>Estudiamos habitualmente operaciones como:</p>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"link_color": "", "link_hover_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "align": "left", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "b11f310"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "26cacbb"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "c8f7478", "settings": {"editor": "<ul><li>Empresas que necesitan liquidez para pagos urgentes, proveedores, impuestos o circulante.</li><li>Propietarios con inmuebles libres de cargas o con cargas asumibles que quieren obtener capital sin vender.</li><li>Inversores que necesitan cerrar una compra, reforma o oportunidad inmobiliaria en Barcelona.</li><li>Promotores con proyectos en marcha que requieren financiaci\u00f3n puente para avanzar de fase.</li><li>Clientes con incidencias bancarias, ASNEF, CIRBE tensionada o rechazo de la banca tradicional.</li></ul>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"link_color": "", "link_hover_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "align": "left", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "4972380"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "1f45b34"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "59b40ba", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Cuando la finalidad est\u00e1 vinculada a compra, reforma o reposicionamiento de activos, tambi\u00e9n podemos estudiar <a href=\"https://proactivofinance.com/prestamos-para-inversion-inmobiliaria-en-barcelona/\"><strong>pr\u00e9stamos para inversi\u00f3n inmobiliaria en Barcelona</strong></a> si la operaci\u00f3n tiene una salida econ\u00f3mica clara.</p>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"link_color": "", "link_hover_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "align": "left", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "213583b"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "bdb642b"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "0938734", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "40", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "af75004", "settings": {"title": "Ventajas del capital privado frente a la banca en Barcelona", "align": "center", "typography_typography": "custom", "title_color": "#FFFFFF", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "020", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "5f94de0"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "eba4fc9"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "heading", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "53b1a40", "settings": {"editor": "<p>La principal diferencia est\u00e1 en el enfoque. Mientras el banco suele partir de filtros r\u00edgidos, el <strong>capital privado</strong> permite valorar la operaci\u00f3n desde el activo y la urgencia real del cliente. Esto es especialmente \u00fatil en Barcelona, donde muchas oportunidades se deciden en d\u00edas.</p>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"link_color": "", "link_hover_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "align": "left", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "40ca019"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "e5dfb10"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "a75288b", "settings": {"flex_direction": "column", "container_type": "grid", "grid_gaps": {"column": "10", "row": "10", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px"}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "presetTitle": "Grid", "presetIcon": "eicon-container-grid", "animation": "fadeInUp", "content_width": "full", "width": {"unit": "%", "size": 100, "sizes": []}, "min_height": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "sizes": []}, "grid_rows_grid": {"unit": "fr", "size": 1, "sizes": []}, "grid_columns_grid_tablet": {"unit": "fr", "size": 1, "sizes": []}, "grid_columns_grid": {"unit": "fr", "size": 5, "sizes": []}}, "elements": [{"id": "8443ac6", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "width": {"unit": "%", "size": 100}, "width_tablet": {"unit": "%", "size": "", "sizes": []}, "width_mobile": {"unit": "%", "size": "", "sizes": []}, "b