, "settings": {"editor": "<ul><li>Viviendas, pisos, \u00e1ticos o casas en Barcelona y su \u00e1rea metropolitana.</li><li>Locales comerciales, oficinas, naves o activos vinculados a actividad empresarial.</li><li>Edificios para rehabilitar, solares urbanos o inmuebles con potencial de desarrollo.</li><li>Inmuebles con cargas previas si el pr\u00e9stamo permite regularizar la situaci\u00f3n.</li><li>Activos destinados a inversi\u00f3n, reforma, alquiler o venta posterior.</li></ul>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"link_color": "", "link_hover_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "align": "left", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "8df297c"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "706ffa1"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "6ce0d78", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Si el objetivo principal es obtener liquidez sobre un inmueble, los <a href=\"https://proactivofinance.com/prestamos-con-garantia-hipotecaria-en-barcelona-proactive\"><strong>pr\u00e9stamos con garant\u00eda hipotecaria en Barcelona</strong></a> pueden ser una alternativa eficaz para transformar patrimonio en capital operativo.</p>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "l